1	# Axon 4.13 — Compiling Example
2	
3	Minimal CQRS/ES slice over the embedded JPA event store: a command + event, an
4	event-sourced `@Aggregate` (constructor + method `@CommandHandler`,
5	`@EventSourcingHandler`), a projection (`@EventHandler`) writing a read model, a
6	saga driving compensation, query handlers, and a controller doing the round trip.
7	Package `com.study.app.*`. Axon 4.13.1 / Spring Boot 3.5.14 / Java 25.
8	
9	> Illustrative slice (one product/customer aggregate elided for brevity). Imports
10	> verified against the Axon 4.x package layout.
11	
12	```java
13	// ---------- com/study/app/command/messages.java (one file per type in practice) ----------
14	package com.study.app.command;
15	
16	import org.axonframework.modelling.command.TargetAggregateIdentifier;
17	import java.util.UUID;
18	
19	// Commands
20	public record CreateOrderCommand(String orderId, UUID customerId, UUID productId, int quantity) {}
21	public record ConfirmOrderCommand(@TargetAggregateIdentifier String orderId, int total) {}
22	public record RejectOrderCommand(@TargetAggregateIdentifier String orderId, String reason) {}
23	
24	// Events
25	record OrderCreatedEvent(String orderId, UUID customerId, UUID productId, int quantity) {}
26	record OrderConfirmedEvent(String orderId, int total) {}
27	record OrderRejectedEvent(String orderId, String reason) {}
28	```
